{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56060","headline":"入道浅深颂 五 · 竟脱","name":"入道浅深颂 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少室与摩竭，第代称扬许。\n我今问汝徒，谁作将来主。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十九，原署「敬脱和尚」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"竟脱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}